# ======================================================================
#  IFBackup — allowlist .gitignore
#
#  The working tree is ~12 GB, almost all of it emulator disk packs and
#  scratch working directories.  GitHub asks for repositories under 1 GB.
#  So this file ignores EVERYTHING by default and then re-admits only
#  what is worth publishing:
#
#      the ports, the documentation, the playable deliverables,
#      the original sources, and the scans they were recovered from.
#
#  Deliberately excluded: every emulator disk image, every work/ dir,
#  and the shared _HP3000_work / _VAX_VMS_work trees.  Those stay on
#  disk; they are simply not published.
#
#  Rule order matters — the LAST matching pattern wins.  Keep the four
#  sections in the order they appear.
# ======================================================================

# ---- 1. ignore everything -------------------------------------------
*

# ...but always descend into directories, or none of the rules below
# would ever get a chance to match.
!*/


# ---- 2. re-admit what we publish ------------------------------------

# repo metadata
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes

# documentation, wherever it lives
!**/*.md

# the ports themselves (port/, port_qemu/, port-fixed/, ...)
!**/port/**
!**/port_*/**
!**/port-*/**

# the original sources and the recovered/extracted material.  Small,
# irreplaceable, and what any future change has to be checked against.
# (Disk images inside these are re-excluded in section 3.)
!**/src_original/**
!**/src_its/**
!**/dump_original/**
!**/dump_1987/**
!**/archive_original/**
!**/recovered/**
!**/reference/**
!**/transcription/**
!**/doc/**
!**/docs/**
!**/notes/**

# games whose deliverable does not live in a port/ dir
!/ASCII-Ladden (C64)/**
!/Google Adventure (Browser)/**
!/Iroha Uta no Nazo (MZ-80B)/**
!/Kjempens Skatt (ZX Spectrum)/**
!/*Sescuballi*/**
!/Sacrifice to the Spider Queen (Coleco Adam)/**
!/Weird Wood 2 (C64)/**
!/Underground (Scans)/**



# ---- 3. ...except these, which are too big or purely derived --------

# Bulk working trees: scratch emulator runs, dirty packs, analysis dumps.
# The /_*_work/ form is deliberate — it covers _HP3000_work, _VAX_VMS_work,
# _HP1000_work and any future one without needing an edit.  Each port keeps
# its own tests/ and tools/, so nothing here is needed to build or verify.
/_*_work/
**/work/

# Emulator disk images and save states (hundreds of MB each).  This list is
# by EXTENSION, so a new project using a format not named here would be
# published by accident — check `git status` before committing a new port.
# Note .img is intentionally absent: the only one is Misty Marsh's 308 KB
# original Wang disk, which we do want.
*.dsk
*.disc
*.rp06
*.sta
*.dmp
*.ext2
*.core

# ...but the Coleco Adam game IS a pair of 164 KB .dsk files
!/Sacrifice to the Spider Queen (Coleco Adam)/*.dsk

# the PL/I port's QEMU bundle: 167 MB of redistributed QEMU plus a
# 60 MB rootfs.  build/README.md documents the Buildroot rebuild, and
# the image belongs on a GitHub Release rather than in git.
**/port_qemu/build/qemu/
**/port_qemu/build/rootfs.ext2
**/port_qemu/build/bzImage


# ---- 4. ordinary build and editor litter ----------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.o
*.obj
fisk.log
zeno.log
**/port/saves/*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
._*
*.swp
*~
.vscode/
.idea/
